  "subject": "two neighbouring green-bamboo-shoot farmers digging by headlamp at four in the morning, racing each other and the sunrise because a shoot that sees the sun turns bitter, with breakfast riding on the count",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien bluegrass in the fast traditional string-band style. A three-finger rolling five-string banjo; a fiddle playing double-stop fills and a short breakdown; a mandolin chopping the offbeat; a flat-picked acoustic guitar with bass-note runs between chords; an upright bass thumping root-fifth on one and three. Live, close, all-acoustic room sound. A bright, slightly nasal male tenor lead with a high, tight two-part harmony on the chorus. 132 BPM, G major. Brisk, muddy-booted and racing the dawn. No drums, no electric guitar, no pop production, no autotune, no country-pop gloss.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n透早四點 山猶未光\n頭殼頂 戴一葩電火\n我佇竹頭邊 一欉一欉揣\n塗若必一縫 筍就佇下底\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n鋤頭 輕輕仔 挖落去\n毋通 傷著 筍尾\n\n[Chorus]\n緊緊緊 日頭欲出來\n筍若 看著日 就會苦\n一枝 兩枝 囥入籠仔\n天光進前 攏愛挖了\n\n[Verse]\n隔壁坵 的阿忠\n伊的電火 比我較光\n伊講 看啥人 挖較濟\n輸的 愛請早頓\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n鋤頭 輕輕仔 挖落去\n蠓仔 叮甲 我規身軀癢\n\n[Chorus]\n緊緊緊 日頭欲出來\n筍若 看著日 就會苦\n阿忠 已經 二十枝\n我才十九 閣差一枝\n\n[Verse]\n山跤 雞仔 啼頭遍\n我的電火 煞愈來愈暗\n跪佇塗跤 用手揣\n指頭仔 摸著 塗必一縫\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n鋤頭 輕輕仔 挖落去\n阿忠 越頭 共我照\n\n[Bridge]\n山頂 紅一爿\n兩个 坐佇竹仔跤 咧喘\n兩跤籠仔 秤起來 平重\n\n[Chorus]\n緊緊緊 日頭出來矣\n今仔日的筍 一枝嘛無苦\n早頓 咱一人請一半\n明仔載四點 閣來拚\n\n[Outro]\n阿忠 你莫睏過頭",
